               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>• BCA with Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning • BCA W</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>• BCA with Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning • BCA With AI Prompt engineering • BCA With Artificial Intelligence and Data Science • B.Sc. Computer Science with Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning • B.Sc. Computer Science with Data Analytics • B.Sc. Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning with Prompt engineering • B.Sc. Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning with Cybersecurity • B.Sc. Information Technology</photoshop:LayerText>
