                  <photoshop:LayerName>• Dedicated Placement Cell offering 100% placement support and </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>• Dedicated Placement Cell offering 100% placement support and career guidance. • Connections with leading national and international companies for internships and jobs. • Resume building, mock interviews, professional grooming and soft skills training. • Career development workshops, seminars and industry expert interactions. • Active alumni network providing mentorship, guidance and networking opportunitie</photoshop:LayerText>
